        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783440/extras/6ad6bc82468c0905e6af59a0ba5361fb.avif?t=1762523481\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783440/extras_big/6ad6bc82468c0905e6af59a0ba5361fb.webp?t=1762523481 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just a man, with nothing but his underwear.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump to Stratos is about all about you Climbing a Very tall Cyberpunk city in nothing but your underwear. Stratos is a race, a test of skill, precision, and will… but you, you don't need that, you have your 4 limbs and that's all you need to get you to the top, but it won't be easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783440/extras/a0a65bd5e4fc5ba49dd3954ed0ab7a35.avif?t=1762523481\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783440/extras_big/a0a65bd5e4fc5ba49dd3954ed0ab7a35.avif?t=1762523481 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Use your Limbs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to climb is to stretch your limbs and hurl yourself at the next platform, but jumping comes with a bone crunching risk so make sure you take time to aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Rolling, Rolling, Rolling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For safety reasons we recommend you stay curled up in a ball at all times! This however comes with the added difficulty of rolling, so try not to roll off the platforms by stabilizing yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >–Obstacles Wipeout!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Stratos race would be nothing without its difficult obstacles! Each obstacle has its own unique way of sending you and your underwear straight back to the start, so take your time and learn them before you go hurling your body at them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setting:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >–Location</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are placed in a Cyberpunk sprawl with multiple city levels, factories and more. You will climb up through the cities on race platforms perfectly placed so every jump is possible but also ragefully hard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >–People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when you thought all the Jumping and Falling was hard you also have to deal with citizens yelling things while you try to focus. Some are supportive, some are not, others are just wondering where your clothes are?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >–Race</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These platforms weren’t cheap! And the Stratos race is a huge event where pilots jump through the city and attempt to get to the end in the best time. However you are a next level specimen and don't need any gear just you and your underwear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783440/extras/6ad6bc82468c0905e6af59a0ba5361fb.avif?t=1762523481\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783440/extras_big/6ad6bc82468c0905e6af59a0ba5361fb.webp?t=1762523481 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Just a man, with nothing but his underwear.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump to Stratos is about all about you Climbing a Very tall Cyberpunk city in nothing but your underwear. Stratos is a race, a test of skill, precision, and will… but you, you don't need that, you have your 4 limbs and that's all you need to get you to the top, but it won't be easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783440/extras/a0a65bd5e4fc5ba49dd3954ed0ab7a35.avif?t=1762523481\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783440/extras_big/a0a65bd5e4fc5ba49dd3954ed0ab7a35.avif?t=1762523481 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Use your Limbs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to climb is to stretch your limbs and hurl yourself at the next platform, but jumping comes with a bone crunching risk so make sure you take time to aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– Rolling, Rolling, Rolling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For safety reasons we recommend you stay curled up in a ball at all times! This however comes with the added difficulty of rolling, so try not to roll off the platforms by stabilizing yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >–Obstacles Wipeout!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Stratos race would be nothing without its difficult obstacles! Each obstacle has its own unique way of sending you and your underwear straight back to the start, so take your time and learn them before you go hurling your body at them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setting:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >–Location</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are placed in a Cyberpunk sprawl with multiple city levels, factories and more. You will climb up through the cities on race platforms perfectly placed so every jump is possible but also ragefully hard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >–People</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when you thought all the Jumping and Falling was hard you also have to deal with citizens yelling things while you try to focus. Some are supportive, some are not, others are just wondering where your clothes are?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >–Race</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These platforms weren’t cheap! And the Stratos race is a huge event where pilots jump through the city and attempt to get to the end in the best time. However you are a next level specimen and don't need any gear just you and your underwear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Jump, tumble, and suffer your way up to the stratosphere in this high-stakes physics platformer where one wrong move can send you plummeting back down to the streets below!",
